    {
      "field": "accessibility.notes",
      "value": "Paths are wood-chip, and some are narrow or uneven, so not every part of the site is easy to reach. Freshly laid wood-chip can be hard going for self-propelled wheelchairs, though aided or electric chairs seem fine. Bethnal Green tube has no step-free access; Whitechapel is the step-free alternative. Email ahead with any access questions.",
